# Xero MCP Server - Environment Variables
# Choose ONE of the three authentication modes below.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MODE 1: OAuth2 Web App (FREE - recommended)
# Create a Web App at https://developer.xero.com/app/manage
# Set redirect URI to: http://localhost:5000/callback
# First run opens a browser for authorization. Tokens are persisted to
# ~/.xero-mcp-tokens.json and auto-refreshed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# XERO_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
# XERO_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here
# XERO_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:5000/callback

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MODE 2: Custom Connection (PAID - requires Xero Custom Connection subscription)
# Create a Custom Connection at https://developer.xero.com/app/manage
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# XERO_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
# XERO_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MODE 3: Bearer Token (manual token management)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# XERO_CLIENT_BEARER_TOKEN=your_bearer_token_here

# Optional: override OAuth scopes (space-separated)
# XERO_SCOPES=accounting.invoices accounting.contacts accounting.settings
